    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## AI as Campaign Manager\r\n\r\nYou are the Pilot in command of your student council race. This AI is your Co-Pilot—it has lots of data and ideas, but you make all the final decisions\r\n\r\n#### How to start:\r\n\r\n* Give your Co-Pilot a mission: Type a prompt using different artifacts from your brainstorming.\r\n\t* _Example: \"I am running for President. My core value is 'Fairness for Everyone.' Can you give me 5 catchy slogans for my posters?\"_.\r\n\r\n* Be the Boss: If the AI gives you an idea you don't like, tell it! You can say, \"Make it shorter\" or \"That doesn't sound like me. Try again with a different tone\".\r\n\r\n* Iterate: Try at least three different prompts to see how the AI's \"patterns\" change based on what you tell it.",
